  "definition": "Permit Expiration",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-12-17",
  "historyNote": "#6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
